-- Equal-priority operators with different associativity directions cannot be
-- chained without parentheses: the grouping would be ambiguous.

@infixr 5
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
      q IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
p CONSR q MEANS p + 10 * q

@infixl 5
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
      q IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
p SNOCL q MEANS p * 10 + q

#EVAL 1 CONSR 2 SNOCL 3
